#: kcmlaunch.cpp:56
msgid "Busy Cursor"
msgstr "Con tro? ba^.n"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:58
msgid ""
"<h1>Busy Cursor</h1>\n"
"KDE offers a busy cursor for application startup notification.\n"
"To enable the busy cursor, check 'Enable Busy Cursor'.\n"
"To have the cursor blinking, check 'Enable blinking' below.\n"
"It may occur, that some applications are not aware of this startup\n"
"notification. In this case, the cursor stops blinking after the time\n"
"given in the section 'Startup indication timeout'"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Con tro? ba^.n</h1> \n"
"KDE cung ca^'p con tro? ba^.n cho tho^ng ba'o chu+o+ng tri`nh startup .\n"
"DDe^? du`ng con tro? ba^.n, nha^.n 'Cho phe'p con tro? ba^.n' .\n"
"DDe^? co' con tro? nha^'p nha'y, nha^'n 'Cho phe'p nha^'p nha'y' o+? du+o+'i .\n"
"Co' the^? xa?y ra la` mo^.t so^' chu+o+ng tri`nh kho^ng bie^'t ddu+o+.c to+'i \n"
"tho^ng ba'o startup na`y . Trong tru+o+`ng ho+.p nhu+ va^.y, con tro? se~ \n"
"du+`ng nha^'p nha'y sau mo^.t tho+`i gian ghi trong pha^`n 'Chi? ddi.nh tho+`i gian timeout startup' "

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:77 kcmlaunch.cpp:120
msgid "Startup indication timeout (seconds) :"
msgstr "Chi? ddi.nh tho+`i gian timeout startup (gia^y) :"

